# Test package of the branch falcon-tempo (tools/testpaket.py on main;
# format in its header).
#
#   Test     number from the test list in docs/05b-Falcon-Tempo.md
#   Machine  falcon, st or beide
#   Source   relative to the root of this worktree
#   Name     8.3, lands in AMBFILES\ beside the game data; - for a folder,
#            which is laid over the root of ATARI\ (the whole build)
#
# Names the game uses itself (ENGINE, INTRO, EXTRO, FANTASY) get a T
# prefix.  Whoever puts a test here leaves its build in place until the
# date; afterwards the lines go.  Moved here by main at the switch,
# 2026-10-21.

T71  falcon  FALCON/AMBFILES/T71FANT.TOS     T71FANT.TOS
T71  falcon  FALCON/AMBFILES/T71MESS.TOS     T71MESS.TOS
